e)–(h), print477/PDF489; local guarded specialization"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>，代入及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}_i\">\\(\\operatorname{Guard}_i\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a77c8090d251f76a\" href=\"?note=a77c8090d251f76a\" title=\"72-df-modal-guarded-context\">72-df-modal-guarded-context</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\)</span> 及有限模型完备性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d40b90e274cadbda\" href=\"?note=d40b90e274cadbda\" title=\"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness\">72-thm-gl-finite-completeness</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\bigl[\\Box_m(B\\leftrightarrow_m C)\\to_m\n(A[B/p_i]\\leftrightarrow_m A[C/p_i])\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\bigl[\\Box_m(B\\leftrightarrow_m C)\\to_m\n(A[B/p_i]\\leftrightarrow_m A[C/p_i])\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在有限传递框架的世界 w，假设所有严格后继满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\leftrightarrow C\">\\(B\\leftrightarrow C\\)</span>。同时归纳证明：任意上下文在 w 及其后继上的 B、C 真值一致时保持替换真值；受保护上下文只需在严格后继上一致。原子和蕴涵直接成立；方框分支将一般归纳用于各个严格后继，其后继也由传递性属于 w 的严格后继。故公式在每个有限 GL 模型有效，完备性给出结论。证明所需的有限完备性沿用上游的证据边界；这里没有额外假设 B、C 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-guarded-context","status":"resolved","id":"a77c8090d251f76a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-guarded-context","status":"resolved","id":"a77c8090d251f76a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$，代入及 $\\operatorname{Guard}_i$ 取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]；$\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 及有限模型完备性取 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-finite-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$，代入及 $\\operatorname{Guard}_i$ 取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]；$\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 及有限模型完备性取 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Guard}_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\bigl[\\Box_m(B\\leftrightarrow_m C)\\to_m\n(A[B/p_i]\\leftrightarrow_m A[C/p_i])\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"B\\leftr